# the MOD track (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-26-mod-track-design.md): ALGORITHM past WEAVE reaches it, SEQ (or
# EDIT) its Lanes page. A lane added from SEL's pickers (T2, Filter, cutoff) and one learned from a knob turned
# elsewhere (the master filter's mix); values tapped on (the target's now) and set with a step held and KNOB 4; glide
# or step on SEL's lane row (the lane picked stays: SEL on a row picks it) and by PRESETS on the page; the list in
# sections (lanes, this lane, new lane); a scene with none ("-"): the page and the list say so, KNOB 1 picks one;
# ALGORITHM through the lanes, then on to the tracks; the knob a lane holds shows the value playing (MOD VIEW) and takes
# over from it; REC held while playing writes the knob's moves; Arrange's KNOB 4 (the scene's MOD pattern) and black
# key 11 (its mute); the grid by the scale; the reader's words; saved and loaded
wait 300
preset 2 acid_line acid
pat 2 1 16 1 60 0
notes 2 1 1 0.5 100 A1
knob 2 cut 40
listen
tap SEQ
spin ALGO 11
wait 600
expect trk 14
expect page Lanes
said Lanes
# a new project's scene plays no MOD pattern ("-"): the page says so (not another pattern's lanes), KNOB 1 picks one
expect smod1 0
expect modsel 0
shot mod_none.png
tap SEL
wait 100
rowval NO MOD PATTERN = KNOB 1 picks one
norow ADD LANE
shot mod_none_list.png
tap HOME
wait 100
spin K1 1
expect smod1 1
wait 100
shot mod_empty.png
# SEL: ADD LANE from the pickers (the "new lane" section)
tap SEL
wait 100
rowval NO LANES YET = add one below
row TRACK
spin ALGO 1
expect rowval TRACK T2
row PAGE
turn ALGO 4
expect rowval PAGE Filter
expect rowval KNOB cutoff
wait 100
shot mod_picker.png
row ADD LANE
tap SEL
wait 100
expect modlanes 1 1
expect modglide 1 1 1
said LANE ADDED T2 cutoff
# the lane's values: a tap on step 1 takes the knob's (40), step 9 held and KNOB 4 turned to 100
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect modval 1 2 cut 1 40
key w8 down
wait 100
spin K4 60
wait 100
key w8 up
expect modval 1 2 cut 9 100
expect par2.cut 40
# a tap on a value takes it off; again puts it back
tapkey w4
expect modval 1 2 cut 5 40
tapkey w4
expect modval 1 2 cut 5 255
# KNOB 1: the scene plays P1 (above); KNOB 2 the length (16), KNOB 3 a step a beat
expect smod1 1
turn K3 3
wait 400
shot mod_glide.png
# playing: the glide from 40 to 100 over steps 1 to 9 (a beat each): at the end of step 4, 40 + 60 x 4 / 8 = 70
tap PLAY
bars 1
expect modpat 1
expect modpos 4
expect live2.cut >66
expect live2.cut <71
wait 200
shot mod_playing.png
# MOD VIEW: KNOB 4 shows the value playing, the knob's own (40) a tick
expect knobnum4 >66
expect knobtick4 41
# the hand: KNOB 4 (cutoff's own knob) takes it back until the next value, from the value playing (~70, not 40)
spin K4 -10
wait 50
expect par2.cut >55
expect par2.cut <63
expect live2.cut -1
bars 1
expect live2.cut -1
bars 0.25
expect live2.cut 100
# LEARN: the master filter's mix turned on GLO's page becomes a lane, the Lanes page back
tap SEL
wait 100
row LEARN
tap SEL
wait 100
expect page Lanes
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Master_filter
spin K3 -10
wait 100
expect page Lanes
expect modlanes 1 2
expect modglide 1 2 1
# the list in sections: lanes, this lane (the learned one, picked), new lane
tap SEL
wait 100
expect rowval LANE_2 master_mix,_glide
rowval lanes = 
rowval this lane: 2, master mix = 
rowval new lane = 
shot mod_lanes.png
# SEL on lane 1's row picks it (the list stays, its section renamed); glide or step on lane 2's row (ALGORITHM left:
# step) leaves lane 1 picked: REMOVE and CLEAR act on lane 1
row LANE 1
tap SEL
wait 100
expect listopen 1
expect modsel 1
rowval this lane: 1, T2 cutoff = 
row LANE 2
spin ALGO -1
expect modglide 1 2 0
expect modsel 1
rowval this lane: 1, T2 cutoff = 
shot mod_sections.png
row LANE 2
tap SEL
wait 100
expect modsel 2
tap HOME
wait 100
# PRESETS on the page: the lane picked glide, step again
turn PRESET 1
expect modglide 1 2 1
said GLIDE master mix
turn PRESET 1
expect modglide 1 2 0
wait 100
# ALGORITHM: lane 1 back, then past it to WEAVE (the tracks), and back to the MOD track
spin ALGO -1
expect trk 14
expect page Lanes
spin ALGO -1
expect trk 13
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 14
expect page Lanes
# REC held while playing: KNOB 4 (lane 1: cutoff) written on the steps as they play (two values before; a step is a
# beat, half a second: the knob turned for two seconds writes four or five)
expect modvals 1 2 cut 2
press REC
turn K4 -20 100
release REC
expect modvals 1 2 cut >5
# 64 steps a bar each: the whole pattern on the page, the keys' bar shaded (OCT+ the next)
spin K2 48
turn K3 4
tap OCT+
wait 400
shot mod_64.png
spin K2 -48
turn K3 -4
tap OCT-
# Arrange: KNOB 4 the scene's MOD pattern (with T... none: "-"); black key 11 mutes it
tap HOME
wait 100
spin K4 -1
expect smod1 0
spin K4 1
expect smod1 1
tapkey b10
expect mute 1024
wait 200
shot mod_arrange.png
tapkey b10
expect mute 0
# a new scene: "-"
tapkey w1
wait 100
expect smod2 0
tap PLAY
# saved and loaded
projsave 1 mod
reboot
wait 400
expect smod1 1
expect smod2 0
expect modlanes 1 2
expect modval 1 2 cut 9 100
expect modval 1 mst mfilt 1 255
